{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2022-12-20 06:30:00', 'title': '3M TO EXIT PFAS MANUFACTURING BY THE END OF 2025', 'text': 'ST. PAUL, MINN. , DEC. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- 3M (NYSE: MMM) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL EXIT PER- AND POLYFLUOROALKYL SUBSTANCE (PFAS) MANUFACTURING AND WORK TO DISCONTINUE THE USE OF PFAS ACROSS ITS PRODUCT PORTFOLIO BY THE END OF 2025.'}